  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roast the red bell peppers in the oven for 30 minutes, then let them cool.",
    "Peel the cooled peppers, remove the seeds, and slice them into strips.",
    "Spread the cream cheese on the toasted Italian bread.",
    "Top the cream cheese with shredded cheddar cheese, shredded lettuce, diced tomato, and thinly sliced red onion.",
    "Add the roasted red pepper strips and dill pickle slices on top of the other ingredients.",
    "Sprinkle chopped fresh parsley over the top of the sandwich.",
    "Serve the sandwich on a tagliere and enjoy."
